        "media_first_mobile": false,
        "subheading": "Why Honey Cloudz?",
        "heading": "Confidence Starts With Comfort™",
        "text": "<p>Bra inserts have long been overlooked. Yet, women were expected to settle for low-quality inserts that shift, bunch, and wear out quickly. <br/><br/>Honey Cloudz exists because you deserve better. <br/><br/>The key to stay-put bra inserts, and what makes <em>Honey Cloudz truly unique</em>, is our <strong>patented grippy-dot  exterior</strong>. It prevents shifting, folding, or sliding, even under the most intense workouts or swimming sessions. <br/><br/><strong>There’s a Cloud that checks all your boxes</strong>. Our wide range of shapes to covers every outfit and levels of thickness to suit your specific needs. <br/><br/>We are a <strong>women-led brand</strong> that focuses on,<strong> high-quality & intentional designs</strong> that look and feel natural, rigorous <strong>testing on real woman bodies, </strong>and <strong>listening and innovating</strong> based on feedback. <br/><br/>That’s how every Cloud delivers comfort, reliability, and fit women can trust.<br/><br/></p>",
