    "custom_multicolumn_B7nRNq": {
      "type": "custom-multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_DHefV7": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon_width": 0,
            "title": "Every Day Wear",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>We don’t believe in a one-size-fits-all bra insert. That’s why we offer a wide range of shapes and sizes. Find the Cloud that best provides the support, coverage, and shaping you’re looking for. Plus, all bra inserts are swim + sweat safe. You can wear them on a regular Tuesday or on your most intense workouts—without compromise!</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "heading_color": "",
            "text_color": "",
            "padding_top": 0,
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "column_jjFqU9": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon_width": 0,
            "title": "Breast Asymmetry",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>More than 80% of women deal with some level of asymmetry. Yet, women still struggle to find something that works with their bodies. Our designs go from ultra-thin inserts to support light asymmetry, to full-cup solutions for a more moderate asymmetry. Our goal is simple: help you look and feel your best in your unique body.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "heading_color": "",
            "text_color": "",
            "padding_top": 0,
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "column_Nntqzw": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon_width": 0,
            "title": "Volume Loss",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Breast volume loss catches many women off guard. Whether it was from pregnancy, breastfeeding, or natural volume loss from aging, Honey Cloudz helps you create a full and natural appearance under any outfit. You body changed, but your confidence doesn’t have to! </p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "heading_color": "",
            "text_color": "",
            "padding_top": 0,
            "padding_bottom": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_DHefV7",
        "column_jjFqU9",
        "column_Nntqzw"
