        "tab_3FzUVP": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Nip Coverage",
            "tab_content": "<p>Sometimes, the pads in our bras, sports bras, swimsuits or dresses aren't enough. Honey Cloudz Inserts help prevent nip-show without adhesives on skin or annoying outlines. Looking for nip-coverage without any bulk? The <a href=\"/products/oval-lites-bra-inserts\" title=\"Oval Lites (Nipple Covers) Bra Inserts\">Oval Lites Bra Inserts</a> or the <a href=\"/products/ovals-classic-bra-inserts\" title=\"Oval Classic Bra Inserts\">Oval Classic Bra Inserts</a> are your best choice.</p>",
            "products": [
              "oval-lites-bra-inserts",
              "oval-classic-bra-inserts",
              "half-moon-classic-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-classic-bra-inserts",
              "half-moon-plus-bra-inserts",
              "oval-plus-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-plus-bra-inserts"
            ]
          }
        },
        "tab_RLcqf3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Balancing",
            "tab_content": "<p>If you're looking to balance uneven sizes or gently restore shape after volume loss or lumpectomy, there's a Cloud for you. Here's a quick guide to find your perfect fit:</p><ul><li>Lites<strong>:</strong> The lightest of all. Ideal for light asymmetry.</li><li>Classics<strong>:</strong> Light, everyday shaping. Creates a natural look + balances up to ½ cup.</li><li>Plus+<strong>:</strong> Double the thickness from Classics. Provides fuller, more defined shaping, and balances up to 1 cup.</li><li>Push-ups<strong>:</strong> Designed ultra-plush and firm to help provide a natural lift and boost any sagging.</li></ul>",
            "products": [
              "oval-classic-bra-inserts",
              "half-moon-classic-bra-inserts",
              "oval-plus-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-push-up-bra-inserts",
              "oval-push-up-bra-inserts",
              "oval-lites-bra-inserts",
              "half-moon-plus-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-plus-bra-inserts",
              "triangle-classic-bra-inserts"
            ]
          }
        },
        "tab_7xTHU8": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "Lifting",
            "tab_content": "<p>Our Push-Up Collection provides a natural boost that creates both fullness and roundness. The gradual padding maximizes the boost (and your confidence!). They’re also lightweight (1-2 oz.), cloud-soft against skin, and don’t create the annoying visible outline.</p>",
            "products": [
              "triangle-push-up-bra-inserts",
              "oval-push-up-bra-inserts"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
