        "shaping_popup_title": "Meet Our Shaping Level Meter",
        "shaping_popup_content": "<p>We created the “Shaping Level Meter” as an easy visual tool to help you identify which Cloudz has the exact amount of shaping you're looking for!<br/><br/><strong>Level 1</strong>: <strong>Ultra-light shaping</strong>. Smooths everything, helps prevent nip-show, and provides barely-there shaping.<br/><br/><strong>Level 2:</strong> <strong>Light shaping.</strong> Provides light, everyday shaping. They help create a natural looking shape, fills for mild breast volume loss, and balances up to 1/2 cup difference.<br/><br/><strong>Level 3:</strong> <strong>Medium shaping</strong>. Fuller and more defined shaping to help smooth divots, fill moderate breast volume loss, and balance up to 3/4 a cup. Also ideal for post-lumpectomy or explant balancing or filling upper breast region for flat-top implants.<br/><br/><strong>Level 4:</strong> <strong>Max shaping</strong>. Delivers our highest level of lift and enhancement to boost sagging, create natural fullness, and restore a perkier silhouette without looking overdone.<br/><br/><strong>Level 5:</strong> <strong>Complete shaping</strong>. Lightweight (1-2 oz.), breathable, and hug friendly breast forms. Designed for women post-mastectomy without breast reconstruction or significant asymmetry. <br/><br/></p>",
